  "_exclusions_comment": [
    "Products that are NOT new entrants. Two lists, because they mean different",
    "things: `tracked` are the 7 products this dashboard already monitors, and",
    "`incumbents` are established players that would otherwise flood the results",
    "and bury the genuinely new arrivals we are looking for."
  ],
